WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.320
(audience cheering)
- Wow.

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.670
- [Kelly] So have y'all met before?

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:04.330
Y'all worked together right?

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:05.163
- We worked together.

00:00:05.163 --> 00:00:06.000
- Yes, we did.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.833
- Yep.

00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:08.130
- With my very good friend

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.710
and late John Ritter.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.880
Bless his soul.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:12.713
- Yes.

00:00:12.713 --> 00:00:13.546
- Was the first time we met.

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:14.580
- Yes.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:15.840
- And we met backstage.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.673
- Yes.

00:00:16.673 --> 00:00:17.820
- I was gonna say to Zosia (laughing)

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:18.810
we go way back? (laughing)

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.180
- We go way way back
to like 25 minutes ago.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.350
- Yes.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:25.050
And what a full 25 minutes it's been.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.067
- Honestly feels like a lifetime.

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:28.266
- Did the chemistry
ignite with y'all as well

00:00:28.266 --> 00:00:30.300
(laughing) your friendship?

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.133
- I have to tell you

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:33.360
your conversation just now

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.170
was amazing because it was so relatable.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.490
Now whether man or woman,

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:40.230
it was so open

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:41.670
and it was like you were two

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:42.990
just sitting in your living room.

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:44.280
- Oh, that's what I want
the show to feel like.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.461
- Well, that's what it felt like.

00:00:45.461 --> 00:00:46.593
- Oh that's so sweet.

00:00:46.593 --> 00:00:47.426
(audience cheering)

00:00:47.426 --> 00:00:48.259
- Okay. I've done my job.

00:00:48.259 --> 00:00:50.160
- No (laughing).

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:50.993
I wanna talk...

00:00:50.993 --> 00:00:51.826
How is your family?

00:00:51.826 --> 00:00:52.659
How are your grandkids?

00:00:52.659 --> 00:00:54.000
- Okay.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.608
- I love how excited
grandparents get about grandkids.

00:00:55.608 --> 00:00:56.441
(laughing)

00:00:56.441 --> 00:00:57.540
- Okay. So we have six.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:58.373
- Oh my God.

00:00:58.373 --> 00:00:59.555
- And the newest is five months old.

00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:00.510
- Oh.

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:01.680
Frances Joan.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.064
And her mother and father
are bringing her tonight.

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:05.897
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:01:05.897 --> 00:01:08.580
- Yes. In order to have a vacation.

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:09.750
At our house.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.040
- [Kelly] So you're gonna help take care

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.030
while they get a little...

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.405
- Oh my God.

00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:15.480
(laughing)

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.100
The last time that she was at our house

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:20.610
I fed her mushed banana

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:22.260
in a spoon with a spoon.

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:23.093
- [Kelly] It's magical.

00:01:23.093 --> 00:01:24.420
- It is in my heart,

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:25.253
I'm telling you.

00:01:25.253 --> 00:01:26.885
It makes me cry when I think about it.

00:01:26.885 --> 00:01:27.780
- Yeah.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:28.770
- Wait, I wanna talk about you more.

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.480
So you're TikTok now.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.980
- Well, because of my granddaughter,

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.090
my older granddaughter.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:33.923
- I know.

00:01:33.923 --> 00:01:35.263
So did she force you to do that.

00:01:35.263 --> 00:01:37.650
- 12 and nine.
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:39.046
- India and Lulu.

00:01:39.046 --> 00:01:39.879
(audience laughing)

00:01:39.879 --> 00:01:41.100
- [Kelly] Look at you.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.483
- [Henry] Oh there they are!

00:01:42.483 --> 00:01:46.203
- [Kaley] Oh my God, you must
be the best grandpa ever.

00:01:46.203 --> 00:01:47.036
- You are the best grandpa ever!

00:01:47.036 --> 00:01:47.980
- I mean I can't.

00:01:49.494 --> 00:01:50.327
- And I gotta say,

00:01:50.327 --> 00:01:51.811
at the very end it kinda looked
like you were twerking, sir.

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:53.880
(laughing)

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:54.840
- You know what,

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.561
if I get the chance I will twerk.

00:01:56.561 --> 00:01:57.394
(laughing)

00:01:57.394 --> 00:02:00.321
(audience cheering)

00:02:00.321 --> 00:02:02.622
- If the spirit moves within me,

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:03.777
