00:02:03.777 --> 00:02:07.650
- The girls said, "Papa,
you have to be on TikTok."

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:08.970
And then they pick the music.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:09.803
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:02:09.803 --> 00:02:12.630
- And then they, one of
them, they're both dancers.

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:14.550
I mean truly gifted dancers

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:17.340
and they kind of pick what we're gonna do.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.750
And then boom, we do it.

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:21.390
So the little one in the front is Lulu,

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:22.590
then is Ace.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:23.730
Ace just turned 10.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:26.160
We took him to Hamilton two weeks ago.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.500
And then behind is India.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.750
India is the choreographer.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.250
- The choreographer, yeah.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.649
Well you killed it.

00:02:33.649 --> 00:02:34.482
- Thank you.

00:02:34.482 --> 00:02:35.315
- You did.

00:02:35.315 --> 00:02:36.148
I am not...

00:02:36.148 --> 00:02:36.981
I've never done a dance.

00:02:36.981 --> 00:02:37.814
I don't feel like going to,

00:02:37.814 --> 00:02:38.647
have y'all done that yet?

00:02:38.647 --> 00:02:39.846
- I refuse to join.

00:02:39.846 --> 00:02:41.446
I can't.

00:02:41.446 --> 00:02:42.279
(laughing)

00:02:42.279 --> 00:02:43.170
This is where I say no.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.040
- This is my line.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:44.873
- Remember this conversation.

00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:46.770
- I never thought I would,

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.770
but when you're shamed into it.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.270
- Yeah. You have to do it.

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.680
- [Kelly] Shame is a powerful tool.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:53.513
- Yes.

00:02:53.513 --> 00:02:55.560
- And lemme just say 13 million views.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:56.708
